   "source": [
    "# Time Series Forecasting - FX Pairs (EUR/USD & GBP/USD)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Project Overview\n",
    "- **Theme**: Finance - Foreign Exchange Rates\n",
    "- **Assets**: EUR/USD and GBP/USD\n",
    "- **Target**: Log returns of EUR/USD\n",
    "- **Data Period**: 2015-01-01 to present (≥5 years, daily)\n",
    "- **Primary Forecast Horizon**: 7 days ahead\n",
    "\n",
    "## Structure\n",
    "1. Data Loading and Preprocessing\n",
    "2. Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
    "3. Classical Models (ARIMA, VAR, VECM, GARCH)\n",
    "4. Advanced Deep Learning Models (LSTM, GRU, Hybrid)\n",
    "5. Model Comparison and Evaluation\n",
    "6. Forecast Visualization"
   ]
  },
